{"comment_text": {"cp29:0.1": "", "cp29:0.2": "", "cp29:0.3": "", "cp29:0.4": "", "cp29:1.1": "", "cp29:1.2": "", "cp29:1.3": "", "cp29:1.4": "", "cp29:2.1": "", "cp29:2.2": "", "cp29:2.3": "", "cp29:2.4": "", "cp29:3.1": "", "cp29:3.2": "", "cp29:3.3": "", "cp29:3.4": "", "cp29:4.1": "", "cp29:4.2": "", "cp29:4.3": "", "cp29:4.4": "", "cp29:5.1": "", "cp29:5.2": "", "cp29:5.3": "", "cp29:5.4": "", "cp29:6.1": "Text’s <i lang='pi' translate='no'>pajahāmi</i> does not seem to fit. Commentary notes variant readings <i lang='pi' translate='no'>paṭīhāmi</i> and <i lang='pi' translate='no'>patīhāmi</i> from <i lang='pi' translate='no'>īhati</i> “to endeavor, to strive”. ", "cp29:6.2": "", "cp29:6.3": "", "cp29:6.4": "", "cp29:7.1": "", "cp29:7.2": "", "cp29:7.3": "", "cp29:7.4": "", "cp29:8.1": "", "cp29:8.2": "", "cp29:8.3": "", "cp29:8.4": "", "cp29:9.1": "", "cp29:9.2": "", "cp29:9.3": "", "cp29:9.4": "", "cp29:10.1": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Me</i> is elided in these lines, per commentary. ", "cp29:10.2": "", "cp29:10.3": "", "cp29:10.4": "", "cp29:11.1": "", "cp29:11.2": "", "cp29:11.3": "", "cp29:11.4": "", "cp29:11.5": "", "cp29:11.6": "", "cp29:12.1": ""}, "html_text": {"cp29:0.1": "<article id='cp29'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "cp29:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "cp29:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "cp29:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "cp29:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "cp29:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:11.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "cp29:11.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "cp29:12.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"cp29:0.1": "Cariyāpiṭaka ", "cp29:0.2": "Yudhañjayavagga ", "cp29:0.3": "Saccapāramī 3 ", "cp29:0.4": "Vaṭṭapotakacariya ", "cp29:1.1": "“Punāparaṁ yadā homi, ", "cp29:1.2": "magadhe vaṭṭapotako; ", "cp29:1.3": "Ajātapakkho taruṇo, ", "cp29:1.4": "maṁsapesi kulāvake. ", "cp29:2.1": "Mukhatuṇḍakenāharitvā, ", "cp29:2.2": "mātā posayatī mamaṁ; ", "cp29:2.3": "Tassā phassena jīvāmi, ", "cp29:2.4": "natthi me kāyikaṁ balaṁ. ", "cp29:3.1": "Saṁvacchare gimhasamaye, ", "cp29:3.2": "davaḍāho padippati; ", "cp29:3.3": "Upagacchati amhākaṁ, ", "cp29:3.4": "pāvako kaṇhavattanī. ", "cp29:4.1": "Dhamadhamāiti evaṁ, ", "cp29:4.2": "saddāyanto mahāsikhī; ", "cp29:4.3": "Anupubbena jhāpento, ", "cp29:4.4": "aggi mamamupāgami. ", "cp29:5.1": "Aggivegabhayātītā, ", "cp29:5.2": "tasitā mātāpitā mama; ", "cp29:5.3": "Kulāvake maṁ chaḍḍetvā, ", "cp29:5.4": "attānaṁ parimocayuṁ. ", "cp29:6.1": "Pāde pakkhe pajahāmi, ", "cp29:6.2": "natthi me kāyikaṁ balaṁ; ", "cp29:6.3": "Sohaṁ agatiko tattha, ", "cp29:6.4": "evaṁ cintesahaṁ tadā. ", "cp29:7.1": "‘Yesāhaṁ upadhāveyyaṁ, ", "cp29:7.2": "bhīto tasitavedhito; ", "cp29:7.3": "Te maṁ ohāya pakkantā, ", "cp29:7.4": "kathaṁ me ajja kātave. ", "cp29:8.1": "Atthi loke sīlaguṇo, ", "cp29:8.2": "saccaṁ soceyyanuddayā; ", "cp29:8.3": "Tena saccena kāhāmi, ", "cp29:8.4": "saccakiriyamuttamaṁ. ", "cp29:9.1": "Āvejjetvā dhammabalaṁ, ", "cp29:9.2": "saritvā pubbake jine; ", "cp29:9.3": "Saccabalamavassāya, ", "cp29:9.4": "saccakiriyamakāsahaṁ. ", "cp29:10.1": "Santi pakkhā apatanā, ", "cp29:10.2": "santi pādā avañcanā; ", "cp29:10.3": "Mātāpitā ca nikkhantā, ", "cp29:10.4": "jātaveda paṭikkama’. ", "cp29:11.1": "Sahasacce kate mayhaṁ, ", "cp29:11.2": "Mahāpajjalito sikhī; ", "cp29:11.3": "Vajjesi soḷasakarīsāni, ", "cp29:11.4": "Udakaṁ patvā yathā sikhī; ", "cp29:11.5": "Saccena me samo natthi, ", "cp29:11.6": "Esā me saccapāramī”ti. ", "cp29:12.1": "Vaṭṭapotakacariyaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"cp29:0.1": "The Conduct Leading to Buddhahood ", "cp29:0.2": "The Chapter With Yudhañjaya ", "cp29:0.3": "The Perfection of Truth (3rd) ", "cp29:0.4": "The Baby Quail’s Conduct ", "cp29:1.1": "“Then again when I was ", "cp29:1.2": "a baby quail in Magadha, ", "cp29:1.3": "I was young, with wings unsprouted, ", "cp29:1.4": "just a scrap of meat in the nest. ", "cp29:2.1": "With food she brought in her beak ", "cp29:2.2": "my mother nurtured me. ", "cp29:2.3": "I survived through her touch, ", "cp29:2.4": "for I had no physical strength. ", "cp29:3.1": "One year, in the hot season, ", "cp29:3.2": "the forest caught fire. ", "cp29:3.3": "It came toward us, ", "cp29:3.4": "a conflagration with a blackened trail. ", "cp29:4.1": "The fire roared and rumbled ", "cp29:4.2": "with great crests of flame, ", "cp29:4.3": "gradually burning ", "cp29:4.4": "closer to me. ", "cp29:5.1": "Alarmed and terrified at the fierce fire, ", "cp29:5.2": "my mother and father ", "cp29:5.3": "abandoned me in the nest, ", "cp29:5.4": "saving themselves. ", "cp29:6.1": "I beat my feet and wings, ", "cp29:6.2": "but I had no physical strength. ", "cp29:6.3": "When unable to leave, ", "cp29:6.4": "I thought this there: ", "cp29:7.1": "‘Those to whom I ought to run, ", "cp29:7.2": "scared and trembling with fear, ", "cp29:7.3": "have escaped, leaving me behind. ", "cp29:7.4": "How should I act today? ", "cp29:8.1": "There is the quality of virtue in the world, ", "cp29:8.2": "truth, purity, and mercy. ", "cp29:8.3": "By this truth I will make ", "cp29:8.4": "a supreme declaration of truth.’ ", "cp29:9.1": "Inspired by the power of Dhamma, ", "cp29:9.2": "recollecting the former Victors, ", "cp29:9.3": "relying on the power of truth, ", "cp29:9.4": "I made a declaration of truth. ", "cp29:10.1": "‘I have wings that do not fly! ", "cp29:10.2": "I have feet that do not walk! ", "cp29:10.3": "Mother and father have fled! ", "cp29:10.4": "Jātaveda the fire: go back!’ ", "cp29:11.1": "As I declared this truth ", "cp29:11.2": "the great crested flames ", "cp29:11.3": "withdrew sixteen leagues, ", "cp29:11.4": "as if they had come to water. ", "cp29:11.5": "There is no one to equal my truthfulness: ", "cp29:11.6": "this is my perfection of truth.” ", "cp29:12.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"cp29:0.1": "", "cp29:0.2": "", "cp29:0.3": "", "cp29:0.4": "", "cp29:1.1": "", "cp29:1.2": "", "cp29:1.3": "", "cp29:1.4": "", "cp29:2.1": "Mukhatuṇḍakenāharitvā → mukhatuṇḍenāharitvā (bj); mukhatuṇḍakena āharitvā (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "cp29:2.2": "", "cp29:2.3": "", "cp29:2.4": "", "cp29:3.1": "", "cp29:3.2": "davaḍāho → davadāho (sya1ed, sya2ed); vanadāho (mr) ", "cp29:3.3": "", "cp29:3.4": "", "cp29:4.1": "", "cp29:4.2": "", "cp29:4.3": "", "cp29:4.4": "", "cp29:5.1": "", "cp29:5.2": "", "cp29:5.3": "", "cp29:5.4": "", "cp29:6.1": "", "cp29:6.2": "", "cp29:6.3": "", "cp29:6.4": "", "cp29:7.1": "", "cp29:7.2": "", "cp29:7.3": "", "cp29:7.4": "", "cp29:8.1": "", "cp29:8.2": "", "cp29:8.3": "", "cp29:8.4": "", "cp29:9.1": "", "cp29:9.2": "", "cp29:9.3": "", "cp29:9.4": "", "cp29:10.1": "", "cp29:10.2": "", "cp29:10.3": "", "cp29:10.4": "", "cp29:11.1": "", "cp29:11.2": "", "cp29:11.3": "", "cp29:11.4": "", "cp29:11.5": "", "cp29:11.6": "", "cp29:12.1": "Vaṭṭapotakacariyaṁ → vaṭṭakapotakacariyaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) "}, "reference_text": {"cp29:0.1": "", "cp29:0.2": "", "cp29:0.3": "", "cp29:0.4": "", "cp29:1.1": "ms21Cp_348, msdiv72, pts-vp-pli1ed98, pts-vp-pli2ed31, sya33.588, vri58.401", "cp29:1.2": "", "cp29:1.3": "", "cp29:1.4": "", "cp29:2.1": "ms21Cp_349, msdiv73", "cp29:2.2": "", "cp29:2.3": "", "cp29:2.4": "", "cp29:3.1": "bj38.314, ms21Cp_350, msdiv74", "cp29:3.2": "", "cp29:3.3": "", "cp29:3.4": "", "cp29:4.1": "ms21Cp_351, msdiv75", "cp29:4.2": "", "cp29:4.3": "", "cp29:4.4": "", "cp29:5.1": "dr33.651, mc2.621, ms21Cp_352, msdiv76", "cp29:5.2": "", "cp29:5.3": "", "cp29:5.4": "", "cp29:6.1": "csp1ed21.415, csp2ed21.415, ms21Cp_353, msdiv77", "cp29:6.2": "", "cp29:6.3": "", "cp29:6.4": "", "cp29:7.1": "ms21Cp_354, msdiv78", "cp29:7.2": "", "cp29:7.3": "", "cp29:7.4": "", "cp29:8.1": "ms21Cp_355, msdiv79", "cp29:8.2": "", "cp29:8.3": "", "cp29:8.4